      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b94c7bc2e096c708fbbb61432656325f39740b8e2151ef905b67f2324bc097c1"
      ],
      "text": "DeepSWE is a benchmark measuring frontier coding agents on original, long-horizon software engineering tasks drawn from active open-source repositories."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_136be139d93078e7a01a6a3da4340afd8ac1775984948462c464518f733e0261",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "specifications",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "0b9fabbb63b9104d678fe965e1632f2dd9eaa2ea",
          "git_sha": "b581622b9cafce263fc78c5a195f4aefc0ca4244",
          "line_end": 3,
          "line_start": 3,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "datacurve-ai/deep-swe",
          "url": "https://github.com/datacurve-ai/deep-swe/blob/0b9fabbb63b9104d678fe965e1632f2dd9eaa2ea/README.md#L3-L3"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b94c7bc2e096c708fbbb61432656325f39740b8e2151ef905b67f2324bc097c1"
      ],
      "text": "The benchmark comprises 113 tasks spanning TypeScript, Go, Python, JavaScript, and Rust, with isolated environments and program-based verifiers."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_515b61b28c01e6812634967f1ccbeb0fd8d71c2f79a74584035395d6e6d7dc91",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "0b9fabbb63b9104d678fe965e1632f2dd9eaa2ea",
          "git_sha": "b581622b9cafce263fc78c5a195f4aefc0ca4244",
          "line_end": 15,
          "line_start": 9,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "datacurve-ai/deep-swe",
          "url": "https://github.com/datacurve-ai/deep-swe/blob/0b9fabbb63b9104d678fe965e1632f2dd9eaa2ea/README.md#L9-L15"
        },
        {
          "commit": "0b9fabbb63b9104d678fe965e1632f2dd9eaa2ea",
          "git_sha": "b581622b9cafce263fc78c5a195f4aefc0ca4244",
          "line_end": 7,
          "line_start": 7,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "datacurve-ai/deep-swe",
          "url": "https://github.com/datacurve-ai/deep-swe/blob/0b9fabbb63b9104d678fe965e1632f2dd9eaa2ea/README.md#L7-L7"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_0b4d9f8d119580dc8705d31a6f5dbdd6ea374692832fe3574d91ba5fd4bb0a5a",
        "slc_154ec38fed256346c30f61729d2642c7bfd8f35cd2eba8d8a69a27f13bf5892b"
      ],
      "text": "Tasks use the Harbor task format, with task.toml metadata, instruction.md, an environment Dockerfile, tests, and a held-out reference solution."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_2fbca97b9da7abbbdbfff1842c20f3361eaf18397db44760d59072a7e2291891",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "evaluation",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "0b9fabbb63b9104d678fe965e1632f2dd9eaa2ea",
          "git_sha": "b581622b9cafce263fc78c5a195f4aefc0ca4244",
          "line_end": 18,
          "line_start": 17,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "datacurve-ai/deep-swe",
          "url": "https://github.com/datacurve-ai/deep-swe/blob/0b9fabbb63b9104d678fe965e1632f2dd9eaa2ea/README.md#L17-L18"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_0bdc1f5cea0fe6a38f2e04da3d5ae6dc209147653ad1c8eed034a6109f960d5c"
      ],
      "text": "The verifier accepts any solution whose observable behavior is correct, regardless of internal symbol names or structure, and the reference patch is never used at grading time."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_4e2ddcdbd7f515d20e8eda03065f1b7aaa7f47bf30f95f4f8afe97870be2bcfa",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "0b9fabbb63b9104d678fe965e1632f2dd9eaa2ea",
          "git_sha": "b581622b9cafce263fc78c5a195f4aefc0ca4244",
          "line_end": 20,
          "line_start": 20,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "datacurve-ai/deep-swe",
          "url": "https://github.com/datacurve-ai/deep-swe/blob/0b9fabbb63b9104d678fe965e1632f2dd9eaa2ea/README.md#L20-L20"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_e563bfc552529c2dd0e4e17b2dac941afbdb0bf3eb7ff39644d71f0da263ba3e"
      ],
      "text": "Since v1.1, grading uses Harbor's separate verifier environment: the agent works in isolation, commits its work, and a collect hook extracts commits as a patch applied and graded in a pristine container."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_f4bd4e999040000f03c5c6adad572761915de4b5be2b26ab519f93c7aab8a303",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "0b9fabbb63b9104d678fe965e1632f2dd9eaa2ea",
          "git_sha": "b581622b9cafce263fc78c5a195f4aefc0ca4244",
          "line_end": 20,
          "line_start": 20,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "datacurve-ai/deep-swe",
          "url": "https://github.com/datacurve-ai/deep-swe/blob/0b9fabbb63b9104d678fe965e1632f2dd9eaa2ea/README.md#L20-L20"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_e563bfc552529c2dd0e4e17b2dac941afbdb0bf3eb7ff39644d71f0da263ba3e"
      ],
      "text": "The separate-verifier grading flow requires the datacurve-pier package at a version newer than 0.3.0."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_58ecac9b533fb9cb23ab9c69e876737673c814a7041cc6c063b58809fd54316e",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "evaluation",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "0b9fabbb63b9104d678fe965e1632f2dd9eaa2ea",
          "git_sha": "b581622b9cafce263fc78c5a195f4aefc0ca4244",
          "line_end": 31,
          "line_start": 24,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "datacurve-ai/deep-swe",
          "url": "https://github.com/datacurve-ai/deep-swe/blob/0b9fabbb63b9104d678fe965e1632f2dd9eaa2ea/README.md#L24-L31"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_8147dc3a20d7ab56a343546c8973279f3820a9c70557f27eec007e8ea5c149a2"
      ],
      "text": "Each run produces verifier outputs including reward.json with binary reward and pass fractions, ctrf.json test reports, raw stdout logs, and framework-native grader reports."
    },
