      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_496cc50f8542cf9c6fd81210f0e8d5a3263ef353a1dca1ef669db8b905533b3a",
        "slc_caa24315c4ab930c54a40a85d167334a28fc8e7805d3710d8a4450c36b9a3873",
        "slc_da9b072391756db1b601f570b0641375624652676cad4a7317fa35bd8a761b0f",
        "slc_df2a7c705728ec1b30f55d5d2fa2c693203e016eeb9dba5f1667a6b0fb571c40"
      ],
      "text": "The benchmark is run via Pier, installed with uv, using commands like 'pier run -p deep-swe/tasks --agent mini-swe-agent' with model-specific API keys exported."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_3bab233abd5bfce5d559362fcd663fcc102bdc351189e2f0c54bac19294f78b4",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "0b9fabbb63b9104d678fe965e1632f2dd9eaa2ea",
          "git_sha": "b581622b9cafce263fc78c5a195f4aefc0ca4244",
          "line_end": 52,
          "line_start": 52,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "datacurve-ai/deep-swe",
          "url": "https://github.com/datacurve-ai/deep-swe/blob/0b9fabbb63b9104d678fe965e1632f2dd9eaa2ea/README.md#L52-L52"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_2803db14a2f0e9284e9cc355d8bf4056833fc8935887d61c23b351a4276053e6"
      ],
      "text": "Pier, a Harbor-compatible eval framework, adds per-agent network allowlists so agents get only needed network access while the task environment stays isolated, unlike Harbor's blanket blocking in no-internet tasks."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_ffede67f18689a3bb68db8c95fed03885addb7a11120a43100c4a8e6e3139ae8",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "0b9fabbb63b9104d678fe965e1632f2dd9eaa2ea",
          "git_sha": "b581622b9cafce263fc78c5a195f4aefc0ca4244",
          "line_end": 58,
          "line_start": 58,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "datacurve-ai/deep-swe",
          "url": "https://github.com/datacurve-ai/deep-swe/blob/0b9fabbb63b9104d678fe965e1632f2dd9eaa2ea/README.md#L58-L58"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_19276c95340d044dbe71db319c8e7676d9691d91d1f40ade39a5468d04b5cecd"
      ],
      "text": "Pier supports multiple agents: mini-swe-agent is model-agnostic, and Pier also drives claude-code, codex, gemini-cli, and opencode; --env modal runs parallel sandboxes on Modal."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_f21fc26059000f3bae36d300a3ca2a4c9f2d891a937f157c9ad11552d6d78c26",
